# Dea/L0{% if stage != "all" %} Stage {{ stage[-1] }}{% endif %} API Documentation

Generated API documentation for the Dea/L0 codebase.

This site is built from source comments and docstrings for:

{% if stage in ["stage1", "all"] %}
- Stage 1 Python compiler sources under `compiler/stage1_py/`
{% endif %}
{% if stage in ["stage2", "all"] %}
- Stage 2 L0 compiler sources under `compiler/stage2_l0/src/`
{% endif %}
- Shared L0 standard library modules under `compiler/shared/l0/stdlib/`
- Shared runtime headers `dea_rt.h`, `dea_siphash.h`, and `l0_runtime.h` under `compiler/shared/runtime/`

Design and reference documents are located in the repository's `docs` directory and are not duplicated here.

## About

- Project: Dea/L0, a small safe C-family systems language that compiles to C99.
- Source repository: [github.com/dea-lang/dea](https://github.com/dea-lang/dea).
- Created and maintained by `gwz` ([\@googlielmo](https://github.com/googlielmo)).

## Overview

This API site supports both source-first and symbol-first browsing.
Source-set hubs provide broad context, source pages and dedicated type pages provide detail.

